cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TARGet: Topology-Aware Fusion-based Radio Frequency Circuit Functional Modeling using Graph Neural Networks"
description: "TARGet is a topology-aware RF circuit modeling codebase implementing FCN, CCI-NN, GNN, and hybrid CCI+GNN architectures."
